<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jan 31 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper up 26100, tin unchanged, lead down 1725, zinc down 1450, aluminium down 10750, nickel down 894, aluminium alloy down 160</p>
</text>
